# Accepted image-scan findings. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:YYYY-MM-DD); after the expiry the scan
# fails again, so the finding is looked at once more.
#
# krb5-libs 1.21.1-10.el9_8.1 (ubi9/openjdk-21-runtime:1.24, 2026-11-14): Trivy reports the RHEL 9.9 build
# 1.21.1-10.el9_9.2 as the fix, but no UBI 9 repository carries it yet, so `microdnf update` in the Dockerfile cannot
# install it. The findings are in the KDC and kadmind servers, which the image neither ships nor runs; the JVM does not
# load the native krb5 library. Remove these lines once the fixed package reaches UBI 9.
